# Task: T006 — Bin picking with suction — fenced mode
# Operating mode: fenced | Max TCP speed: 0.400 m/s
# Robot: ur5e | Payload: 2.0 kg
# Safety: Confinement zone active

def task_T006():
    # Safety check
    if get_digital_in(0) == True:
        popup("E-Stop active — aborting program.", error=True)
        halt
    end

    # [1] Home position
    movej([0.0000, -1.5708, 1.5708, -1.5708, -1.5708, 0.0000], a=1.4000, v=0.3500)

    # [2] Approach bin
    movel(p[0.450000, -0.200000, 0.350000, 0.0000, 3.1416, 0.0000], a=1.5000, v=0.3500, r=0.0150)

    # [3] Descend into bin
    movel(p[0.450000, -0.200000, 0.100000, 0.0000, 3.1416, 0.0000], a=0.8000, v=0.1500)

    # [4] Activate suction
    set_digital_out(0, True)
    sleep(0.3000)

    # [5] Lift from bin
    movel(p[0.450000, -0.200000, 0.400000, 0.0000, 3.1416, 0.0000], a=1.2000, v=0.3000, r=0.0150)

    # [6] Transit to conveyor
    movel(p[0.450000, 0.250000, 0.400000, 0.0000, 3.1416, 0.0000], a=1.8000, v=0.3800, r=0.0200)

    # [7] Descend to drop
    movel(p[0.450000, 0.250000, 0.150000, 0.0000, 3.1416, 0.0000], a=1.0000, v=0.2000)

    # [8] Release part
    set_digital_out(0, False)
    sleep(0.2000)

    # [9] Retract above conveyor
    movel(p[0.450000, 0.250000, 0.400000, 0.0000, 3.1416, 0.0000], a=1.5000, v=0.3500, r=0.0100)

    # [10] Return to home
    movej([0.0000, -1.5708, 1.5708, -1.5708, -1.5708, 0.0000], a=1.4000, v=0.3500)

end

# Entry point
task_T006()